{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SymboCalc 是一款符號運算計算機，讓答案保持精確，而不是隻給出小數近似值。無論是分解多項式、解方程、微分、積分或求逆矩陣，都可以在同一款應用程式內完成，而且全部運算均在裝置上進行。適合修讀數學、工程或理科的學生，以及需要處理符號運算的研究人員與工程師。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-203.webp\">\n<h2>精確符號運算與繪圖分析</h2>\n<p>SymboCalc 預設輸出精確答案，1/3 就是 1/3，根式、分數與複數以符號形式排版呈現，點按答案即可切換成小數。代數支援展開、因式分解與化簡；微積分涵蓋導數、定積分、極限與微分方程；另有方程求解、矩陣特徵值、函數繪圖、迴歸模型與概率分佈，並可匯出 PDF 工作表。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-249-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-250-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-251-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-252-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SymboCalc</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:39:24.562372+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:32:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:57:40.948941+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:38:15.997765+00:00","content_hash":"d67a00bc2255b2d7cebb5ab2aa5b34f9fe656a28c994ec1f24ed9fd7165c59cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}